# Frontend

- Components live in `frontend/src/components/[ComponentName].tsx`.
- Pages live in `frontend/src/pages/[PageName].page.tsx` and set `document.title`.
- Every HTML element gets an `id` as its first attribute.
- Style with Tailwind. Merge classes with `cn()` from `frontend/src/lib/cn.ts`.

```tsx
export function HomePage() {
  useEffect(() => {
    document.title = "ce-git";
  }, []);

  return <main id="home-page">...</main>;
}
```

A new IPC call needs three pieces: a Rust command, a camelCase type in `types/git.ts`, and a wrapper in `frontend/src/lib/git-client.ts`.
